_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1711005_1775497716_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1711005_1775497716_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">尤文主场2-0击败热那亚，意甲5轮不败，距离前四仅1分。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/69d3d297a92c6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">意甲积分榜：米兰近3轮仅1胜降第3，那不勒斯反超升第2距国米7分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.97" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260407/202604070600362022.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.97" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.97" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260407/202604070600362022_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260407/202604070600362022_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">意甲第31轮，米兰0-1客负那不勒斯遭排名反超、尤文2-0轻取热那亚距欧冠区仅1分，来看看最新积分榜情况。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/match1741426date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘三连胜！本菲卡1-1卡萨匹亚距榜首7分 里奥斯破门布里托扳平</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1741426_1775510843_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1741426_1775510843_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1741426_1775510843_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">本菲卡在客场以1-1战平卡萨匹亚。积分榜方面，本菲卡积66分排在第三，卡萨匹亚积25分排在第16位。</span></p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/69d3fe23c9ef1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">拒绝归队养伤！那不勒斯总监：卢卡库清楚这事会相应的后果</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250415/67fd75a26ded4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250415/67fd75a26ded4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250415/67fd75a26ded4.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">那不勒斯vs米兰赛前，那不勒斯总监曼纳接受采访，谈到了卢卡库选择留在比利时养伤，而不是回归俱乐部一事。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/69d4060309747native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">每体：德科计划今夏出售费兰、卡萨多，球队财政紧张难以签拉师傅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/696970da62acf_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/696970da62acf.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/696970da62acf.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">每日体育报撰文透露，德科的夏窗计划中重点关注了费兰·托雷斯和卡萨多。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/69d3f99fb2fe5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">外媒：内马尔接受了膝盖手术，希望世界杯前恢复至最佳状态</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250206/67a438396c54e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">